    "detailed_description": "<h1>Extra</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/e2bf7e3256e080cbb7fabfb739eb9997.avif?t=1745568872\" data-has-big width=800 height=1376 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The average human life expectancy soared ever higher: not good for business in the Underworld. And so, it shifted to focus on package delivery services instead. Business boomed, until a fateful incident that saw a cola delivery get mixed up with one for Lady Meng's Forgetfulness Tea... All employees who sipped the netherworld beverage lost their souls, drifting into the River of the Dead. The influx was too much for the Underworld to handle. Deliveries lagged behind schedule, stolen left right and center by ne'er-do-well spirits, while the former employees had all lost their memories. Help would not arrive: they could only dig through the piles of packages themselves in hope of finding their lost souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, one such employee, may well have to fight against your own soulless colleagues as well as those wicked souls stealing deliveries.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/227186dab4d8a2daf9268ffed7c040d6.avif?t=1745568872\" width=650 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extending as far as the eye can see are ghoulish beings and monstrous creatures of all kinds. Slay them to build Honor, and spend it to draw a range of mighty magical powers. We prepared:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/4cc4cc4e1d09126128672969979153d9.poster.avif?t=1745568872\" width=650 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/4cc4cc4e1d09126128672969979153d9.webm?t=1745568872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/4cc4cc4e1d09126128672969979153d9.mp4?t=1745568872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >26 Primary Skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 Secondary Skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >55 Passives</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/53a505feb32d718541090d1d2a9254cd.avif?t=1745568872\" width=650 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many a mystical figure resides deep in the Underworld. Retrieve items for them, and they might just lend you their aid. Though your memories may be lost, your duty remains: survive to be the last one standing!     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/02dec395b5d44329c8f00abf19cc32ef.avif?t=1745568872\" width=650 height=118 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Utilize a wide array of Omens to keep foes reeling. Seek out good Omens, and cast bad Omens aside!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/9f843ff42fd5843552af45b697b04200.poster.avif?t=1745568872\" width=650 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/9f843ff42fd5843552af45b697b04200.webm?t=1745568872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/9f843ff42fd5843552af45b697b04200.mp4?t=1745568872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the way to work, the underworld has managed relationships and selected 15 Underworld Omens for you. But everything has a price, and &quot;relationships&quot; are not given in vain. Each time you upgrade, you will receive &quot;three good things and one bad thing.&quot; <strong>Used wisely, even a weaker Omen can turn the tides completely.</strong>     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/8374b8c8fc7c43266903595e180f314e.avif?t=1745568872\" width=650 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not feeling these new memories? Want to switch classes? Not to worry: Lady Meng of the Underworld has prepared you a fresh batch of her Forgetfulness Tea.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/16a1bd62fa1f3f974f57c52d08335b2d.poster.avif?t=1745568872\" width=650 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/16a1bd62fa1f3f974f57c52d08335b2d.webm?t=1745568872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/16a1bd62fa1f3f974f57c52d08335b2d.mp4?t=1745568872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a sip, and take on a new role\u2014work hard, and good luck out there! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/3db4d3dee0c403d7c0eaa6139d8a65aa.avif?t=1745568872\" width=650 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Underworld battlefield can be a lot to take in. If you're struggling, check out the Omenopedia for details on each Omen's effects. Know your Omens, know the enemy as you know yourself, and you're sure to go far.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The average human life expectancy soared ever higher: not good for business in the Underworld. And so, it shifted to focus on package delivery services instead. Business boomed, until a fateful incident that saw a cola delivery get mixed up with one for Lady Meng's Forgetfulness Tea... All employees who sipped the netherworld beverage lost their souls, drifting into the River of the Dead. The influx was too much for the Underworld to handle. Deliveries lagged behind schedule, stolen left right and center by ne'er-do-well spirits, while the former employees had all lost their memories. Help would not arrive: they could only dig through the piles of packages themselves in hope of finding their lost souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, one such employee, may well have to fight against your own soulless colleagues as well as those wicked souls stealing deliveries.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/227186dab4d8a2daf9268ffed7c040d6.avif?t=1745568872\" width=650 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extending as far as the eye can see are ghoulish beings and monstrous creatures of all kinds. Slay them to build Honor, and spend it to draw a range of mighty magical powers. We prepared:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/4cc4cc4e1d09126128672969979153d9.poster.avif?t=1745568872\" width=650 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/4cc4cc4e1d09126128672969979153d9.webm?t=1745568872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/4cc4cc4e1d09126128672969979153d9.mp4?t=1745568872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >26 Primary Skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 Secondary Skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >55 Passives</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/53a505feb32d718541090d1d2a9254cd.avif?t=1745568872\" width=650 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many a mystical figure resides deep in the Underworld. Retrieve items for them, and they might just lend you their aid. Though your memories may be lost, your duty remains: survive to be the last one standing!     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/02dec395b5d44329c8f00abf19cc32ef.avif?t=1745568872\" width=650 height=118 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Utilize a wide array of Omens to keep foes reeling. Seek out good Omens, and cast bad Omens aside!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/9f843ff42fd5843552af45b697b04200.poster.avif?t=1745568872\" width=650 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/9f843ff42fd5843552af45b697b04200.webm?t=1745568872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/9f843ff42fd5843552af45b697b04200.mp4?t=1745568872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the way to work, the underworld has managed relationships and selected 15 Underworld Omens for you. But everything has a price, and &quot;relationships&quot; are not given in vain. Each time you upgrade, you will receive &quot;three good things and one bad thing.&quot; <strong>Used wisely, even a weaker Omen can turn the tides completely.</strong>     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/8374b8c8fc7c43266903595e180f314e.avif?t=1745568872\" width=650 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not feeling these new memories? Want to switch classes? Not to worry: Lady Meng of the Underworld has prepared you a fresh batch of her Forgetfulness Tea.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/16a1bd62fa1f3f974f57c52d08335b2d.poster.avif?t=1745568872\" width=650 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/16a1bd62fa1f3f974f57c52d08335b2d.webm?t=1745568872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/16a1bd62fa1f3f974f57c52d08335b2d.mp4?t=1745568872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a sip, and take on a new role\u2014work hard, and good luck out there! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078920/extras/3db4d3dee0c403d7c0eaa6139d8a65aa.avif?t=1745568872\" width=650 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Underworld battlefield can be a lot to take in. If you're struggling, check out the Omenopedia for details on each Omen's effects. Know your Omens, know the enemy as you know yourself, and you're sure to go far.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
